ne; the taller man's hand claws upward, grabbing a wrist. Hold on that locked tension as the frame ends.\n\nCamera: handheld throughout with restrained breathing shake; small-amplitude push-ins, one short arc, no wide shots, no pull-backs that shrink the faces.\n\nAudio: narrow alley ambience, distant traffic hum, a dripping pipe, the low buzz of the sodium lamp. Physical sounds sharp and close: knuckle impact on cheekbone, boot soles scraping wet concrete, fabric tearing, a body thudding against a metal door, the door's hinge shrieking. Both men breathing hard through their noses, a wet cough, a low pained grunt. One line of dialogue delivered hoarse and mocking. No music until the final half-second, where a single low percussive hit lands on the last frame.\n\nNo text, subtitles, captions, logos or watermarks. No extra characters entering frame. No cross-dissolves, fades or wipes. No slow-motion."}},{"id":149,"type":"QQSaveVideo","pos":[-460,4840],"size":[570,620],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":256},{"localized_name":"fps","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","link":257},{"localized_name":"seconds","name":"seconds","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"seconds"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"自定义帧位置","name":"自定义帧位置","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"自定义帧位置"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"filename_prefix","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"format","name":"format","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"format"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"codec","name":"codec","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"codec"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"time_format","name":"time_format","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"time_format"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"视频","type":"VIDEO","links":null},{"localized_name":"每秒首帧","name":"每秒首帧","type":"IMAGE","links":null},{"localized_name":"最后一帧","name":"最后一帧","type":"IMAGE","links":null},{"l